<p><strong>Min-heap</strong><br>
For a min-heap to determine the minimum value within each range [<code>i</c=
ode>, <code>i + k</code>], it will always need to be populated with the val=
ues in these ranges as we iterate through the array. Let's see how this wor=
ks over the same example.</p>
